# Herat Dental Union — Headless WordPress Theme

The WordPress backend for the **Herat Dental Union** site: a headless theme that
turns WordPress into a structured content API, consumed by a separate Next.js
front-end.

> A [Cyborg Tech Creative Agency](https://github.com/CyborgTech-co) project.
> Front-end: [`hdu`](https://github.com/CyborgTech-co/hdu).

---

## What it does

- **Headless by design** — WordPress manages content; rendering happens in the
  Next.js front-end
- **Custom REST endpoints** — bespoke API routes tailored to the site's content
- **Advanced Custom Fields** — structured, editor-friendly content modeling
- **Editor-first** — non-technical staff manage content through familiar WordPress

## Tech stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| CMS | WordPress (headless) |
| Content model | Advanced Custom Fields (ACF) |
| API | Custom REST endpoints + WordPress REST API |
| Language | PHP |

## Structure

```text
HDU-WordPress/
  functions.php     # Theme setup, REST endpoints, ACF wiring
  includes/         # Supporting PHP modules
  page-*.php        # Page templates
  style.css         # Theme header and base styles
  index.php         # Entry
```

## Getting started

1. Copy the theme into `wp-content/themes/` and activate it.
2. Install and activate **Advanced Custom Fields**.
3. Configure the field groups and content the endpoints expect.
4. Point the [`hdu`](https://github.com/CyborgTech-co/hdu) front-end at this
   site's API base URL.
